    "chunk_text": "& he is bebyrged on Winceastre. Bellum apud mare mortuum. Her on \u00feisum geare for\u00f0ferde Leo se halga papa on Rome. & on \u00feisum geare w\u00e6s swa mycel orfcwealm.swa man ne gemunde fela wintrum \u00e6r. & Uictor w\u00e6s gecoren to papan. Her on \u00feisum geare for\u00f0ferde Siward eorl. & \u00fea bead man ealre witenagemot vii nihton \u00e6r mid lenctene.& utlagode mann \u00c6lfgar eorl.for\u00f0on & he \u00fe\u00e6s geanwyrde wes \u00e6tforan eallum \u00feam mannum \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r gegaderode w\u00e6ron.\u00feeah him \u00fe\u00e6t & se cyng geaf \u00feone eorldom Tostige Godwines sunu eorles.\u00f0e Siward eorl \u00e6r ahte. & \u00c6lfgar eorl gesohte Griffines geheald on Nor\u00f0 Wealan.& on \u00feisum geare Griffin & \u00c6lfgar .hic Henricus Romanorum imperator obiit.cui successit filius eius Henricus. Her on \u00feisum geare com \u00c6dward \u00e6\u00f0eling Eadmundes sunu cynges hider to lande.& sona \u00fe\u00e6s & Victor papa for\u00f0ferde.& w\u00e6s Stephanus gecoren to papan.se w\u00e6s abbot on Monte Cassiono. & Leofric eorl for\u00f0ferde & feng \u00c6lfgar his sunu to \u00feam eorldome \u00fee se f\u00e6der \u00e6r h\u00e6fde. Her on \u00feisum geare for\u00f0ferde Stephanus papa.& w\u00e6s Benedictus gehalgod to papan.se ylca s\u00e6nde & on \u00feisum geare for\u00f0ferde Heaca biscop on Su\u00f0 Seaxan.& Stigand arcebiscop hadode \u00c6gelric Her on \u00feisum geare w\u00e6s Nicolaus to papan gecoren.",
